=\"element-wrap\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; z-index: 1; margin-top: 15px;\" data-id=\"1526701582976\" data-icon=\"gpicon-textblock\" data-label=\"Text Block\">\r\n<div class=\"elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-justify-lg gf-elm-justify-md gf-elm-justify-xs gf-elm-justify-sm\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: justify; width: 530px; display: block; line-height: 1.6em; font-size: 15px;\" data-exc=\"\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: inherit; font-family: inherit; line-height: inherit; text-align: inherit; padding: 0px;\">Spritz Wellness embodies a balanced lifestyle of wellness, yoga, exercise and living with purpose. The use of aromatherapy, be it through an atmosphere mist or a scented eye pillow or mask, is just one way to be grounded and find calm in a very busy world. The Spritz Wellness brand embodies timeless style, passion and quality. Great care and attention to detail is put into our products, with each designed to stimulate the senses, calm the mind, energise the soul and enhance the sleep experience. All eye pillows, eye masks, atmosphere mists and yoga mat sprays are lovingly crafted in the UK with all natural ingredients.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"c-1526701441019\" class=\"gf_column gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; min-height: auto; padding-left: 15px; padding-right: 15px; position: relative; float: left; width: 600px; z-index: 1; margin: 0px;\" data-id=\"1526701441019\">\r\n<div id=\"r-1526703127197\" class=\"gf_row gf_row-gap-20\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 1200px; padding-top: 30px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-bottom: 11px;\" data-extraclass=\"\" data-row-gap=\"20px\" data-id=\"1526703127197\" data-icon=\"gpicon-row\" data-label=\"Row\">\r\n<div id=\"c-1526703104023\" class=\"gf_col-md-12 gf_column gf_col-sm-12\" style=\"box-sizing: border-bo